    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d135-a2">

                <pb facs="0211" n="204" sameAs="frus:frus1894Nicaragua/pg204"/>

                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Inclosure 2 in No. 135.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Kimberley House</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1894-12-21"><hi rendition="#italic">December 21,
                        1894</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Dear Mr. Bayard</hi>: Mr. Bertie informs me that he
                    gave Mr. Wells, who brought your letter of yesterday to him, an answer as to the
                    matters referred to in it.</p>
                <p>I am very glad that you enabled us to contradict the reports in question, which
                    have no foundation whatever.</p>
                <p>Believe me, sincerely yours,</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Kimberley.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
